FROM /sda2/GLM-4.7-Flash-4bit

# GLM-4.7-Flash-4bit Model for Ollama with AirLLM integration
# Model: zai-org/GLM-4.7-Flash (4-bit quantized)
# Size: ~15.7 GB
# Architecture: Glm4MoeLiteForCausalLM (Mixture of Experts)

PARAMETER num_ctx 4096
PARAMETER num_batch 8
PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1

# Low-memory configuration for GPU-poor systems
PARAMETER num_gpu 1
PARAMETER num_thread 8

SYSTEM You are GLM-4.7-Flash, a large language model developed by Z.ai.
You are designed to be helpful, harmless, and honest.
You excel at understanding and generating content in both Chinese and English.
